### Registrar un veterinario
POST http://localhost:8080/api/veterinarians/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "garcia@vet.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "firstName": "Carlos",
  "lastName": "García",
  "licenceNumber": "MP-1234"
}

### Listar veterinarios
GET http://localhost:8080/api/veterinarians

### Registrar otro veterinario
POST http://localhost:8080/api/veterinarians/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lopez@vet.com",
  "password": "mipassword",
  "firstName": "Ana",
  "lastName": "López",
  "licenceNumber": "MP-5678"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lopez@vet.com",
  "password": "mipassword"
}

### GET sin token (debería fallar)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/veterinarians

### GET con token (copiá el token del login)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/veterinarians
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJhdWQiOiJtaW1hcy1hcHAiLCJpc3MiOiJtaW1hcy1iYWNrZW5kIiwiaWQiOjIsImVtYWlsIjoibG9wZXpAdmV0LmNvbSIsImV4cCI6MTc4MDA3NDA1NX0.vXumQZ9cbe7UavGF4v1jjVc-8yGJQ6j8Eg8ygAXp9mA

